{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 2 x plus 3\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 7 x minus 2\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 5 x plus 6\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The functions <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi>\n</math>, and <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> are defined as shown. If <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis dot g left parenthesis x right parenthesis minus h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a x squared plus b x plus c\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>, where <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math>, and <math alttext=\"c\"><mi>c</mi>\n</math> are constants, what is the value of <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math>?</p>", "keys": ["eb306860-4d66-4a13-bc29-7abfab701bb4"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "f97fa28d-e9bd-49f3-ac84-7f76a29b6026", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"negative 5\"><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "eb306860-4d66-4a13-bc29-7abfab701bb4", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"12\"><mn>12</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "7705c4d1-995a-4064-925c-1094045f6ba3", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"20\"><mn>20</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "e4df56e6-0700-454c-bf8b-dbcb64c22030", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"22\"><mn>22</mn>\n</math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. It&rsquo;s given that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 2 x plus 3\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 7 x minus 2\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 5 x plus 6\"><mi>h</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></math>. It&rsquo;s also given that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis dot g left parenthesis x right parenthesis minus h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a x squared plus b x plus c\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi></math>, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"c\"><mi>c</mi></math> are constants. Substituting <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"2 x plus 3\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"7 x minus 2\"><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"5 x plus 6\"><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>h</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> in this equation yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 2 x plus 3 right parenthesis left parenthesis 7 x minus 2 right parenthesis minus left parenthesis 5 x plus 6 right parenthesis equals a x squared plus b x plus c\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>. Applying the distributive property to the left-hand side of this equation yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 2 x right parenthesis left parenthesis 7 x right parenthesis plus left parenthesis 2 x right parenthesis left parenthesis negative 2 right parenthesis plus left parenthesis 3 right parenthesis left parenthesis 7 x right parenthesis plus left parenthesis 3 right parenthesis left parenthesis negative 2 right parenthesis plus left parenthesis negative 1 right parenthesis left parenthesis 5 x right parenthesis plus left parenthesis negative 1 right parenthesis left parenthesis 6 right parenthesis equals a x squared plus b x plus c\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>, or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"14 x squared minus 4 x plus 21 x minus 6 minus 5 x minus 6 equals a x squared plus b x plus c\"><mn>14</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>21</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>. Combining like terms on the left-hand side of this equation yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"14 x squared plus 12 x minus 12 equals a x squared plus b x plus c\"><mn>14</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>. It follows that the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"12\"><mn>12</mn></math>.</p>\n<p>Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p>Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p>Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>", "externalid": "2aeea10a-c9ed-426c-912a-939dedc77aac", "correct_answer": ["B"]}